# Phone-shaped (9:16) recording for 抖音 / 小红书 / Shorts — `vhs demo/demo-vertical.tape`.
# Then: ffmpeg -i docs/assets/fleetmux-demo-vertical.gif -movflags faststart -pix_fmt yuv420p -vf "scale=720:-2" docs/assets/fleetmux-demo-vertical.mp4
Output docs/assets/fleetmux-demo-vertical.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 720
Set Height 1280
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "FLEETMUX_DEMO_LAYOUT=vertical source demo/setup.sh" Enter
Sleep 2s
Show

Sleep 3s
Ctrl+q
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Ctrl+q
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Ctrl+q
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
